      "kind": "lede",
      "html": "<p>A plumbing inspection report records the state of a building's water systems on one day. It says what you found, what needs work, and how urgent each item is. Done well, it protects everyone. Done badly, the only proof is in someone's memory.</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "takeaways",
      "heading": "The short version",
      "html": "<ul><li>A good plumbing inspection report template UK covers pipework, joints, pressure, drainage, and hot and cold water.</li><li>Landlords must show upkeep under the Landlord and Tenant Act 1985. A report is that evidence.</li><li>It is not a legal certificate like a Gas Safety Record. It still carries weight.</li><li>Record pressure results at the moment of the test.</li><li>Photos on the Record are stronger than words alone.</li><li>Work through the checklist in order so nothing is skipped.</li></ul>"
