      "kind": "default",
      "eyebrow": "What to record",
      "heading": "Cover every system",
      "html": "<p><strong>Cold water:</strong> incoming main, stop valve, mains pressure, and any storage tank. Check the cover, overflow and signs of contamination. <strong>Hot water:</strong> system type, cylinder and expansion vessel, relief valve and discharge pipe, temperature, and Legionella risk control.</p><p><strong>Pipework:</strong> corrosion, past repairs, clips, lagging in unheated areas, flexible hoses under sinks. <strong>Joints:</strong> weeping compression joints, pushfit not fully home, pitted solder. <strong>Drainage:</strong> flow, traps, smells, partial blockages. <strong>Sanitary ware:</strong> WC flush and fill valve, seals, leaks behind panels.</p>"
    },
